{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id456530598"}, "name":{"label":"Butt head bill"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-23T11:51:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5310027434"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing"}, "content":{"label":"This game is so good. It’s creative, visually beautiful, and has a subtle way of showing a story of a father and a son. The only problem is it ends. I wish it didn’t. I wish I could play beautiful LEGO puzzles every day. Please add more. I just want to play more.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id38539109"}, "name":{"label":"KhestraKaramak"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-23T10:38:32-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5309839724"}, "title":{"label":"Didn’t Expect This Much Awesomeness"}, "content":{"label":"I was bored so I downloaded this puzzle app thinking “oh how cute, Legos...not my first choice but ok...let’s try this.”  But instead of a lame building app to pass the time, I ended up with 25 levels of really fun puzzles with a variety of Lego pieces that are easy to control, and solutions just difficult enough to make me feel accomplished instead of annoyed or running to walkthroughs.  That being said, I ran through all the current puzzles pretty quickly, and need more.  Hoping this gets updated!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id24026532"}, "name":{"label":"Jmilus"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-23T10:14:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5309762218"}, "title":{"label":"More like this, please."}, "content":{"label":"This game is beautiful, emotional, clever, and TOO SHORT. Hopefully more like it is on the way. That is not at all to say this game isn’t worth it, but I do hope the developers are rewarded with a million downloads, and in turn rewards us with more levels.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
