{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id39634038"}, "name":{"label":"taliancich"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-22T07:56:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5305083085"}, "title":{"label":"A New Direction for LEGO Games"}, "content":{"label":"LEGO has always had a niche carved out for more subtle and artistic building sets (Architecture series for example), but rarely, if ever, has that made it into their video game properties.\n\nBuilder’s Journey, however, distills LEGO building into its most pure properties - imagination, emotion, intelligence - in a universe that allows room for exploration and pontification in a way that LEGO sets, games and films lately tied to 3rd party licenses do not.\n\nAlthough the game is incredibly short, I hope it is just the beginning of a new direction for LEGO games (and maybe even some abstract sets), as it is a breath of fresh air among the desperate LEGO fan service cash grabs of late (I’m talking to you LEGO Stranger Things).", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"7"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"8"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id34389837"}, "name":{"label":"pbeasi"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-21T23:01:32-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5303279594"}, "title":{"label":"Beautiful game"}, "content":{"label":"This game is beautiful and my only complaint is that I wish it were longer.  But what you get is a short, fun puzzle game with a neat minimalist story.  No real brain burning here but that’s actually in its favor as in many cases you can build however you want as long as it works.  \n\nGreat addition to Apple Arcade.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
