{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id101145324"}, "name":{"label":"_jaybee_"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-21T14:39:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5301856853"}, "title":{"label":"Fun, but just a bit too short."}, "content":{"label":"Beautifully done game, with some curious but very LEGO mechanics, but it’s just too short. There are some user interface frustrations, around moving and setting pieces, but nothing so bad I put the phone down in annoyance. \n\nIf you liked Monument Valley, you’ll enjoy this game.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
