{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id911152872"}, "name":{"label":"arcinus451"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-21T14:36:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5301849921"}, "title":{"label":"Wowowowowowowowowowowow!!!!!!!!!!"}, "content":{"label":"Ok,so let me point out that I LOVE this game.When my dad told me about this new game,I was like, “Oh,nice.”But when I actually played it,I was like, “OMG THIS IS A GREAT GAME!”I mean,it’s so great but so hard.\nBut I like that it’s hard.Kind of.Just,basically,the title of this review is what I meant to write.Bye!\n\n                                  -The person who wrote you this", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id35995493"}, "name":{"label":"bittlebox"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-21T14:25:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5301817429"}, "title":{"label":"Addictive"}, "content":{"label":"Now I want more!  I’m an older adult that usually gets bored part way through a game... not this one.  Great game to play for a few hours start to finish.  Can only hope they will make more levels in updates.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id164270326"}, "name":{"label":"woah it so good"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-21T10:53:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5301189739"}, "title":{"label":"Bruh"}, "content":{"label":"This game too good to be real", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1103579798"}, "name":{"label":"jarate lafate"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-21T08:13:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5300643852"}, "title":{"label":"Great game"}, "content":{"label":"I usually avoid writing reviews. I have to say, this game is outstanding. I’ve always enjoyed LEGO games and this one is a new spin on the format with innovative and creative gameplay. \n\nI will say it is a bit short and perhaps a bit easy for seasoned players. I played through in about an hour. I’m sure the developers want the game to be accessible to younger audiences, hence the ease of most of the puzzles, but I would love to see an expansion, perhaps difficulty settings.\n\nI like that there are no hints and often multiple solutions, forcing players to tap into their childlike creativity and “builder” sensibilities to solve puzzles.\n\nOverall, I loved it and want to see more.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id601622184"}, "name":{"label":"Wilson Nicklaus"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-21T00:18:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5298932203"}, "title":{"label":"Short and sweet"}, "content":{"label":"I really enjoyed this game. It is a peaceful puzzler, and a beautiful game all together. It tells a story well and simple. The graphics and soundtrack is wonderful. The controls are simple as well, and quite easy to learn. Very relaxed. A 5 star game for sure.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id892715556"}, "name":{"label":"digitalfrost111"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-21T00:07:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5298899728"}, "title":{"label":"This game made me feel something"}, "content":{"label":"While super simplistic, it really hits me, harder than a lot of other things. My own personal live and relationship with my own father/father figure was built off of LEGO’s. And seeing something like this is really sweet and it made me really tear up. It’s a very fluent and well done game, but the story itself, hits me so hard. Just the memories flood back because it’s the same product just on a phone screen rather than a cardboard box.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
