{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id25574729"}, "name":{"label":"Hydride"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-20T15:31:16-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5297430927"}, "title":{"label":"Decent start, could use refinement"}, "content":{"label":"The game has promise, but the camera angle automatically drifts back to the default angle when you pick up a piece. You can't place a piece behind another piece due to this. You basically have to start over to work with the default camera angle. This is annoying.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id108427510"}, "name":{"label":"zmclearan"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-20T14:52:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5297330399"}, "title":{"label":"This is Fantastic!"}, "content":{"label":"I am not quite sure where to begin. The visuals are stunning, the audio is incredible, and the overall feel of this game is beautiful. This game is just begging to have an AR mode!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1009908962"}, "name":{"label":"Gwells21"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-20T13:46:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5297165499"}, "title":{"label":"Short, But Sweet."}, "content":{"label":"I really enjoyed this game! It gave me the satisfaction of playing with real LEGO. My only issue is it is a bit difficult to see where you are putting down your LEGO piece. If this game had a highlight or some sort of indication for where you are putting your piece down like in the newer Tetris games for example, then this game would be a solid 90/100. The game’s issue is not a deal breaker, but it would be greatly appreciated if fixed.\n\n85/100", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id299671298"}, "name":{"label":"Jadenfire"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-20T13:33:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5297129763"}, "title":{"label":"Not what I was expecting...."}, "content":{"label":"Second Apple Arcade LEGO another dud.\nI want a long playing game not a short thing!\nSeriously ANYTHING built for Apple Arcade has been short or boring! Catquest 2 & OceanHorn 2 are the only things that are long well & now Sasquatch as a update added more.\n\nIt’s short it’s boring & it’s not the usual LEGO game x.x \nIt’s not fun it’s not creative ..\nBut hey each to there own rather continue playing m LEGO worlds, LEGO city undercover & LEGO friends all are way better & way better then this....\n\nSeriously Apple Arcade needs more Creative long running games, painting, drawing, building, simulation..", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id898855736"}, "name":{"label":"PasLaLaitue"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-20T13:02:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5297043548"}, "title":{"label":"Brings back so much"}, "content":{"label":"I played with legos a tonne as a kid, and I have so many fond memories of building amazing things with them. This game brings back so much and makes me so happy😁 the gameplay is great, and the story is pretty good so far, but it’s the memories that this brings back and the beauty of the graphics that make this game amazing! Try it out! You have nothing to lose!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id914690518"}, "name":{"label":"Evilmititis"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-20T12:31:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5296962317"}, "title":{"label":"Unexpectedly... INCREDIBLE."}, "content":{"label":"I got an email saying this game was available for Arcade, and I figured I’d try it out because it’s LEGO and LEGO is usually pretty cute and fun. Oh boy, didn’t realize this game was going to be that well developed. It’s a sweet and simple little narrative puzzle game that has beautiful music, fantastic graphics, and isn’t too challenging yet still keeps your brain working. Honestly, everything about it was actually done really well. I was not expecting something like that from this game. It’s one of the best games I’ve played yet on Arcade, even if it’s really short. I hope there’s a sequel or something similar.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
